### ===== Upload ảnh (multipart; REST Client: dùng file thật) =====
POST {{base}}/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----antgo

------antgo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="anh.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./anh-mau.png
------antgo--

